{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01314",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 5.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.41,
      "end_seconds": 11.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.5,
      "end_seconds": 19.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Oh, hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.78,
      "end_seconds": 24.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "please do. Extra information is always welcome"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.94,
      "end_seconds": 41.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.83,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a painful rash on one side of my chest. I've never really been one for hospitals. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.8,
      "end_seconds": 45.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.45,
      "end_seconds": 55.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "Well, for about two weeks, I'd say. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.68,
      "end_seconds": 66.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.3,
      "end_seconds": 75.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Yes, clothes rubbing and touch. That makes it worse. Honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.71,
      "end_seconds": 81.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.72,
      "end_seconds": 91.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Erm, when it starts I tend to get burning pain before the rash as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.68,
      "end_seconds": 101.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 101.19,
      "end_seconds": 108.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Well, uh, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.1,
      "end_seconds": 119.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.14,
      "text": "Well, I was getting to that! Uh, the burning pain before the rash? That's been for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.0,
      "end_seconds": 125.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "have you noticed weakness, contact with chickenpox or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.46,
      "end_seconds": 142.14,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "No, no weakness, no contact with chickenpox, no confusion. I did have small blisters in a band at one point, but that that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.08,
      "end_seconds": 147.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Have you had any vision changes or rash on the other side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.83,
      "end_seconds": 156.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "erm, I haven't had vision changes or rash on the other side, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.94,
      "end_seconds": 160.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.73,
      "end_seconds": 163.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.7,
      "end_seconds": 168.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.12,
      "end_seconds": 170.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.8,
      "end_seconds": 187.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.61,
      "end_seconds": 192.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I take ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 192.85,
      "end_seconds": 200.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "He is supposed to take it every morning, but I can't say he always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.1,
      "end_seconds": 212.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I take something called mirt... mirtazapine, 15 milligrams, maybe, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.85,
      "end_seconds": 218.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.3,
      "end_seconds": 234.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "not with me i'll bring it it next time it's Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.01,
      "end_seconds": 240.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Okay, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.11,
      "end_seconds": 250.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.99,
      "end_seconds": 253.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.08,
      "end_seconds": 257.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.74,
      "end_seconds": 268.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.3,
      "end_seconds": 272.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure. Yes, depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.22,
      "end_seconds": 275.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.52,
      "end_seconds": 278.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I've got acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.24,
      "end_seconds": 288.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Okay, I can see acid reflux in your file as well. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.74,
      "end_seconds": 292.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Actually, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.87,
      "end_seconds": 297.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.57,
      "end_seconds": 301.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.42,
      "end_seconds": 306.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.28,
      "end_seconds": 319.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.31,
      "end_seconds": 345.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 94, oxygen saturation is 95 percent, pressure 110 over 67."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.47,
      "end_seconds": 352.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.76,
      "end_seconds": 354.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.46,
      "end_seconds": 357.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Hold that that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.05,
      "end_seconds": 379.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "There are clustered blisters on a red base in a band across the right side of the chest, not crossing the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.44,
      "end_seconds": 389.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "You can relax now. I'd like to arrange a swab from a blister for vesicular rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 390.52,
      "end_seconds": 393.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.22,
      "end_seconds": 396.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.15,
      "end_seconds": 408.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "I'll start you on aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. That should help with shingles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.86,
      "end_seconds": 414.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "ah, how soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.75,
      "end_seconds": 447.5,
      "duration_seconds": 31.75,
      "text": "Keep the rash clean and dry and avoid contact with pregnant women or newborns until the blisters crust over. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Do get help quickly if the rash spreads to the eye or face. I'll want another look if the pain persists after a month. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 451.62,
      "end_seconds": 455.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Oh, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.1,
      "end_seconds": 459.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "All the the best."
    }
  ]
}